
@startuml
!theme spacelab
title POST /guitar/orders/api/orders - Secure Order Creation

actor "End User" as User
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Keycloak IDP" as Keycloak
participant "Orders Service" as Orders

User -> Gateway : 1. POST /guitar/orders/api/orders (No Token)
Gateway --> User : 2. 401 Unauthorised / Redirect to Login

== Authentication ==

User -> Keycloak : 3. Enter Credentials
Keycloak --> User : 4. Issue Authorisation Code
User -> Keycloak : 5. Exchange Code for JWT
Keycloak --> User : 6. Return Signed JWT (with Roles)

== Authorized Request ==

User -> Gateway : 7. POST /api/orders + Bearer JWT
activate Gateway
Gateway -> Gateway : 8. Validate JWT Signature & Roles

alt User has 'ORDERS' Role
    Gateway -> Orders : 9. Forward Request
    activate Orders
    Orders -> Orders : 10. Persist Customer & Order
    Orders --> Gateway : 11. 201 Created
    deactivate Orders
    Gateway --> User : 12. Success Response
else User lacks 'ORDERS' Role
    Gateway --> User : 13. 403 Forbidden
end
deactivate Gateway

@enduml